BEHAVIOR build-output
DESCRIPTION
  Assembles the output line(s): a 19-char "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS" timestamp,
  then " PROCESSED BY CONSUMER\n" (23 bytes), then the request body.
  Returns the assembled buffer and its total length.
CONTRACT
  INPUT timestamp bytes 32
  INPUT body bytes 65536
  INPUT body_length int 8
  OUTPUT result bytes 65536
  OUTPUT length int 8
  REQUIRES string-to-bytes@a2e66e29 copy@05c62b49 iadd@8b41ba23
HASH 3f274f08
COMPOSITION
  mid = CALL string-to-bytes " PROCESSED BY CONSUMER\n"
  c1 = CALL copy timestamp 0 result 0 19
  DISCARD c1.bytes_copied
  c2 = CALL copy mid.data 0 result 19 mid.length
  DISCARD c2.bytes_copied
  off1 = CALL iadd 19 mid.length
  c3 = CALL copy body 0 result off1.sum body_length
  DISCARD c3.bytes_copied
  total = CALL iadd off1.sum body_length
  SET length total.sum
END
